  "accounting": "Web success requires submission, valid 303 receipt and redirect display. Verified 303 is a durable acknowledgement for DAT comparison even if display fails; such failures remain errors. Final read-only DAT audit retries only 503 within a shared 5-second window and records retries. Unavailable reads are unknown, not evidence of missing posts; a mismatched 200 body is never retried.",
