    "Final 1CPU/256MiB overload: 957/2000 full flow, 958 acknowledged; one acknowledged Web display failed. Recovery69/100 has intermittent refusal. All acknowledged posts match DAT; no OOM.",
    "Final 8CPU/3GiB at planned5000: 2311/2311 issued full flows succeed, 2689 unissued within window, recovery100/100, DAT exact, no OOM. Mean CPU1.58 cores; no full-utilization claim.",
    "CPU/memory policies support 1-64 GOMAXPROCS and 32MiB-12GiB synthetic budgets. Actual pressure trials cover 1CPU/256MiB, 2CPU/512MiB and 12CPU/3GiB.",
    "This verifies resource adaptation and measured OOM avoidance; it does not establish universal throughput improvement or a stable maximum posting rate."
